  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi>p</mi></math> and <math><mi>q</mi></math> be the length of two chords of a circle which subtend angles <math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> respectively at the centre of the circle. Then, the angle (in radian) subtended by the&nbsp;chord of length <math><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;at the centre of the circle is</p>\r\r<p>(use&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.86",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7387a87b-1828-4004-a8a2-2bf2d4b6a31e.png\" style=\"width:1.27986in;height:1.56667in\" /><br />If <math><mi>l</mi></math> is the length of the chord, then <math><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> .<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi>n&#160;</mi><msup><mn>18</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi>